  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1425/853/title-png.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_35387524-87cb-4c95-90f1-2ac1ca2f2cea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">內容</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">此擴充包為 Alien Evo 新增了發條怪（時械神）作為一種新變形。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Prototype、OV、10K 與 UAF</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_a3a6949c-8563-408e-80c6-8df0917829ce.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_10e64346-a098-4794-9654-68137fb4c562.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">與科技泡泡融合</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_d30ae19e-4c56-4a12-87c0-2dae587074ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">取得方式</h2>\n<p>在主世界區域尋找<strong>惡徒的時光獸</strong>。擊敗這些獸類以獲得<strong>時鐘零件</strong>，並製作<strong>時械神 DNA</strong> 來解鎖發條怪。&nbsp;或透過指令&nbsp;<code>/alienautoadd</code>&nbsp;取得。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_879bfca1-fef1-41de-848f-774822542a3b.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_cfc1f2af-e093-4197-b744-034f9a6babf2.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_14763aa3-e0db-4215-ab61-5ccf5747a70e.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_73665f29-215c-43a1-ab36-76b43b5c197e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">能力展示</h2>\n<p>時械神並非華麗奪目的英雄，而是擁有極其複雜機制的角色。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_92ed5766-6053-4383-b893-6c30bda9f046.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_3dd4421b-4813-4622-8611-0de531b4e3fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">重要道具</h2>\n<p>加爾文羅盤：右鍵點擊可探測礦脈（冷卻時間 4 秒）。潛行右鍵點擊可定位全球三處惡徒零件的位置。加爾文電磁脈衝槍：用於發射電磁脈衝（EMP），使範圍內生物承受更多傷害，並削弱時械神。使用全能水晶充能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_019f19ac-67fe-4b51-96e9-5193b3c2e7c7.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bfa4ab07-8e95-423d-8b2f-2fa4b85402bd.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p>時械神定時炸彈：擊敗惡徒後獲得。右鍵點擊設定程式，將目標生物從當前時間軸中抹除。需要時鐘鑰匙進行充能。對惡徒無效。可使用 Sotobro 效應倒轉時間將其喚回。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_21350384-c2f9-42ff-92b1-5137402c2ae7.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fed5b0ab-8f18-4c04-9b07-820db38ab1b5.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">最終 BOSS 惡徒</h2>\n<p>惡徒鑰匙、齒輪、Hex、第一部分與第二部分：這些零件散佈在主世界各處。依序放置於祭壇上即可召喚惡徒。Exo-Skull 與 Subdora 也在尋找這些零件。當惡徒爆炸時，零件與祭壇會隨機重生。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_8648003d-6566-45f2-bcd2-83c9d4a2f127.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bf91b5f8-acda-46b7-9cb7-02760c97d0a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>指令 <code>/chrono locate</code> 可讓你定位目標，點擊座標即可傳送。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fdd55f27-5b3f-49fd-8cd4-e3465f50a027.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_97e6ec8c-5f30-4891-83cc-65cb13890c8c.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<hr>",
